{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43312","headline":"早春送郎官出宰 · 袁求贤","name":"早春送郎官出宰","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"仙郎今出宰，圣主下忧民。\n紫陌轩车送，丹墀雨露新。\n趋程犹犯雪，行县正逢春。\n粉署时回首，铜章已在身。\n鸣琴化欲展，起草恋空频。\n今日都门外，悠悠别汉臣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"袁求贤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43312.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43312","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}